        "original_id": "d0c60bac-603f-5a6d-b3ca-f755f92b5315",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Grapico, Izze\n- Companies: Buffalo Rock\n- Places: Southeastern United States\n- Topics: soft drinks, fruit soda\n\nFacts:\n- In 1981, Buffalo Rock produced Grapico, a grape-flavored soft drink, under its own brand name.\n- In 1981, Buffalo Rock also produced a ginger ale under its own brand name.\n- Grapico is a caffeine-free, artificially flavored carbonated soft drink.\n- Grapico has a purple color and a grape taste.\n- Grapico is sold in the Southeastern United States.\n- Izze is an all-natural fruit soda with no preservatives added.",
